"omission of some of its letters (e.g. 'adj.' for 'adjective')"
msgstr ""

#: src/catalog/catalogstring.cpp:134
msgctxt "XLIFF mark type"
msgid ""
"acronym: an abbreviated form of a term made up of letters from the full form "
